   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "Size every piece from the latest site measurement, as the tape or the laser itself reads, and from the latest photos of the room. A drawing set shows a house as it was surveyed, before any rough-in, so its dimensions are a starting point only.",
